     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>The negation of a logical statement has the opposite truth value of the original statement.</p>\n<p>Original statement: Adele has a lovely singing voice.</p>\n<p>Add “not.”</p>\n<p>Negation: Adele does not have a lovely singing voice.</p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "Adele does not have a beautiful voice."
